{"type":"data","nodes":[{"type":"data","data":[{"latestDate":1},"2026-08-18"],"uses":{}},{"type":"data","data":[{"model":1,"htmlContent":7},{"name":2,"description":3,"url":4,"category":5,"subcategory":6},"Claude Opus 4","First Claude 4-generation flagship, launched alongside Sonnet 4 with hybrid reasoning and extended thinking.","https://ai-tldr.dev/models/claude-opus-4/","Anthropic","Claude Opus","\u003Csection id=\"overview\" class=\"lrn-section\" aria-labelledby=\"overview-h\">\u003Ch2 class=\"lrn-h2\" id=\"overview-h\">\u003Cspan class=\"lrn-h2-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">//\u003C/span> Overview\u003C/h2>\u003Cp class=\"lrn-p\">Claude Opus 4 is a large language model from Anthropic, the flagship of the Claude 4 generation released on May 22, 2025. At launch Anthropic positioned Claude Opus 4 as its most capable model and described it as the world's best coding model, built for complex, long-running tasks that can require thousands of steps and several hours of continuous work.\u003C/p>\u003Cp class=\"lrn-p\">Claude Opus 4 accepts text and image input and returns text, with a 200K-token context window and up to 32K output tokens. It is a hybrid reasoning model that offers both near-instant responses and an extended-thinking mode for deeper, step-by-step reasoning. Pricing at launch was $15 per million input tokens and $75 per million output tokens.\u003C/p>\u003Cp class=\"lrn-p\">Claude Opus 4 was superseded by Claude Opus 4.1 (August 2025) and later Opus 4.x releases, and the original snapshot (claude-opus-4-20250514) has since been retired. It remains a notable milestone as the model that launched Anthropic's Claude 4 line and its leading position on agentic coding benchmarks.\u003C/p>\u003Cdiv class=\"lrn-table-wrap\">\u003Ctable class=\"lrn-table\">\u003Ctbody>\u003Ctr>\u003Cth scope=\"row\">Released\u003C/th>\u003Ctd>2025-05-22\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Cth scope=\"row\">License\u003C/th>\u003Ctd>Proprietary\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Cth scope=\"row\">Weights\u003C/th>\u003Ctd>API only\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Cth scope=\"row\">Context\u003C/th>\u003Ctd>200K\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Cth scope=\"row\">Max output\u003C/th>\u003Ctd>32K\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Cth scope=\"row\">Modalities\u003C/th>\u003Ctd>Text, Vision\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Cth scope=\"row\">Status\u003C/th>\u003Ctd>Retired\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003C/tbody>\u003C/table>\u003C/div>\u003C/section>\u003Csection id=\"benchmarks\" class=\"lrn-section\" aria-labelledby=\"benchmarks-h\">\u003Ch2 class=\"lrn-h2\" id=\"benchmarks-h\">\u003Cspan class=\"lrn-h2-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">//\u003C/span> Benchmarks\u003C/h2>\u003Col class=\"mdl-chart\" aria-label=\"Benchmark scores\">\u003Cli class=\"mdl-chart-row\">\u003Ca class=\"mdl-chart-name\" href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" title=\"Source: anthropic.com\">SWE-bench Verified\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"mdl-chart-track\">\u003Cspan class=\"mdl-chart-fill\" style=\"width:72.5%\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mdl-chart-val\">72.5%\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\u003Cli class=\"mdl-chart-row\">\u003Ca class=\"mdl-chart-name\" href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" title=\"Source: anthropic.com\">Terminal-bench\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"mdl-chart-track\">\u003Cspan class=\"mdl-chart-fill\" style=\"width:43.2%\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mdl-chart-val\">43.2%\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\u003Cli class=\"mdl-chart-row\">\u003Ca class=\"mdl-chart-name\" href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" title=\"Source: anthropic.com\">GPQA Diamond\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"mdl-chart-track\">\u003Cspan class=\"mdl-chart-fill\" style=\"width:74.9%\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mdl-chart-val\">74.9%\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\u003Cli class=\"mdl-chart-row\">\u003Ca class=\"mdl-chart-name\" href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" title=\"Source: anthropic.com\">MMLU\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"mdl-chart-track\">\u003Cspan class=\"mdl-chart-fill\" style=\"width:87.4%\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mdl-chart-val\">87.4%\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\u003Cli class=\"mdl-chart-row\">\u003Ca class=\"mdl-chart-name\" href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" title=\"Source: anthropic.com\">MMMU\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"mdl-chart-track\">\u003Cspan class=\"mdl-chart-fill\" style=\"width:73.7%\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mdl-chart-val\">73.7%\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\u003Cli class=\"mdl-chart-row\">\u003Ca class=\"mdl-chart-name\" href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" title=\"Source: anthropic.com\">AIME 2025\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"mdl-chart-track\">\u003Cspan class=\"mdl-chart-fill\" style=\"width:33.9%\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mdl-chart-val\">33.9%\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\u003C/ol>\u003Cp class=\"mdl-chart-cap\">Scores on a 0–100 scale (25-point gridlines); higher is better. Each benchmark links to its published source.\u003C/p>\u003C/section>\u003Csection id=\"pricing\" class=\"lrn-section\" aria-labelledby=\"pricing-h\">\u003Ch2 class=\"lrn-h2\" id=\"pricing-h\">\u003Cspan class=\"lrn-h2-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">//\u003C/span> Pricing\u003C/h2>\u003Cdiv class=\"lrn-table-wrap\">\u003Ctable class=\"lrn-table\">\u003Ctbody>\u003Ctr>\u003Cth scope=\"row\">Input\u003C/th>\u003Ctd>\u003Cspan class=\"mdl-price-amt\">$15.00\u003C/span> \u003Cspan class=\"mdl-price-unit\">per million tokens\u003C/span>\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Cth scope=\"row\">Output\u003C/th>\u003Ctd>\u003Cspan class=\"mdl-price-amt\">$75.00\u003C/span> \u003Cspan class=\"mdl-price-unit\">per million tokens\u003C/span>\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003C/tbody>\u003C/table>\u003C/div>\u003Cp class=\"lrn-p\">\u003Ca href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Pricing source ↗\u003C/a>\u003C/p>\u003C/section>\u003Csection id=\"strengths\" class=\"lrn-section\" aria-labelledby=\"strengths-h\">\u003Ch2 class=\"lrn-h2\" id=\"strengths-h\">\u003Cspan class=\"lrn-h2-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">//\u003C/span> Strengths\u003C/h2>\u003Cul class=\"lrn-list\">\u003Cli>Agentic coding — 72.5% on SWE-bench Verified at launch, which Anthropic cited as best-in-class\u003C/li>\u003Cli>Sustained long-horizon work — designed to run continuously for hours across thousands of steps\u003C/li>\u003Cli>Hybrid reasoning with an extended-thinking mode for harder, multi-step problems\u003C/li>\u003Cli>Strong graduate-level reasoning and knowledge (74.9% GPQA Diamond, 87.4% MMLU)\u003C/li>\u003Cli>Multimodal text + image understanding (73.7% MMMU)\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>\u003C/section>\u003Csection id=\"use-cases\" class=\"lrn-section\" aria-labelledby=\"use-cases-h\">\u003Ch2 class=\"lrn-h2\" id=\"use-cases-h\">\u003Cspan class=\"lrn-h2-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">//\u003C/span> Best for\u003C/h2>\u003Cul class=\"lrn-list\">\u003Cli>Autonomous and agentic coding workflows\u003C/li>\u003Cli>Large-codebase refactors and multi-file software tasks\u003C/li>\u003Cli>Long-running agents that execute many sequential steps\u003C/li>\u003Cli>Complex reasoning and technical research\u003C/li>\u003Cli>Document and image analysis\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>\u003C/section>\u003Csection id=\"access\" class=\"lrn-section\" aria-labelledby=\"access-h\">\u003Ch2 class=\"lrn-h2\" id=\"access-h\">\u003Cspan class=\"lrn-h2-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">//\u003C/span> How to access\u003C/h2>\u003Cdiv class=\"lrn-table-wrap\">\u003Ctable class=\"lrn-table\">\u003Cthead>\u003Ctr>\u003Cth>Provider\u003C/th>\u003Cth>Model ID\u003C/th>\u003C/tr>\u003C/thead>\u003Ctbody>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/claude/opus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Anthropic ↗\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>\u003Ccode>claude-opus-4-20250514\u003C/code>\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003C/tbody>\u003C/table>\u003C/div>\u003C/section>\u003Csection id=\"history\" class=\"lrn-section\" aria-labelledby=\"history-h\">\u003Ch2 class=\"lrn-h2\" id=\"history-h\">\u003Cspan class=\"lrn-h2-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">//\u003C/span> Claude Opus — every version\u003C/h2>\u003Cp class=\"lrn-p\">The full lineage of the Claude Opus line, newest first. Every version has its own page — click any to compare specs, benchmarks and pricing.\u003C/p>\u003Cdiv class=\"lrn-table-wrap\">\u003Ctable class=\"lrn-table lrn-cmp\">\u003Cthead>\u003Ctr>\u003Cth>Version\u003C/th>\u003Cth>Released\u003C/th>\u003Cth>Context\u003C/th>\u003Cth>License\u003C/th>\u003C/tr>\u003C/thead>\u003Ctbody>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd class=\"lrn-cmp-name\">\u003Ca href=\"/models/claude-opus-5/\" data-internal=\"true\">Claude Opus 5\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"mdl-cmp-badge\">current\u003C/span>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>2026-07-24\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>1M\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>Proprietary\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd class=\"lrn-cmp-name\">\u003Ca href=\"/models/claude-opus-4-8/\" data-internal=\"true\">Claude Opus 4.8\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>2026-05-28\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>1M\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>Proprietary\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd class=\"lrn-cmp-name\">\u003Ca href=\"/models/claude-opus-4-7/\" data-internal=\"true\">Claude Opus 4.7\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>2026-04-16\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>—\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>Proprietary\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd class=\"lrn-cmp-name\">\u003Ca href=\"/models/claude-opus-4-6/\" data-internal=\"true\">Claude Opus 4.6\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>2026-02-05\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>—\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>Proprietary\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd class=\"lrn-cmp-name\">\u003Ca href=\"/models/claude-opus-4-5/\" data-internal=\"true\">Claude Opus 4.5\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>2025-11-24\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>—\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>Proprietary\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd class=\"lrn-cmp-name\">\u003Ca href=\"/models/claude-opus-4-1/\" data-internal=\"true\">Claude Opus 4.1\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>2025-08-05\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>—\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>Proprietary\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr class=\"lrn-cmp-cur\">\u003Ctd class=\"lrn-cmp-name\">\u003Cstrong>Claude Opus 4\u003C/strong>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>2025-05-22\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>—\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>Proprietary\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd class=\"lrn-cmp-name\">\u003Ca href=\"/models/claude-3-opus/\" data-internal=\"true\">Claude 3 Opus\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>2024-03-04\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>—\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>Proprietary\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003C/tbody>\u003C/table>\u003C/div>\u003C/section>\u003Csection id=\"faq\" class=\"lrn-section lrn-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-h\">\u003Ch2 class=\"lrn-h2\" id=\"faq-h\">\u003Cspan class=\"lrn-h2-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">//\u003C/span> FAQ\u003C/h2>\u003Cdetails class=\"lrn-faq-item\">\u003Csummary>When was Claude Opus 4 released?\u003C/summary>\u003Cp>Anthropic released Claude Opus 4 on May 22, 2025, as the flagship model of the Claude 4 generation alongside Claude Sonnet 4.\u003C/p>\u003C/details>\u003Cdetails class=\"lrn-faq-item\">\u003Csummary>What is Claude Opus 4's context window and max output?\u003C/summary>\u003Cp>Claude Opus 4 has a 200K-token context window and can generate up to 32K output tokens per response. It accepts both text and image input.\u003C/p>\u003C/details>\u003Cdetails class=\"lrn-faq-item\">\u003Csummary>How much did Claude Opus 4 cost?\u003C/summary>\u003Cp>Claude Opus 4 was priced at $15 per million input tokens and $75 per million output tokens via the Anthropic API.\u003C/p>\u003C/details>\u003Cdetails class=\"lrn-faq-item\">\u003Csummary>Is Claude Opus 4 still available?\u003C/summary>\u003Cp>No. The original snapshot (claude-opus-4-20250514) has been retired. It was succeeded by Claude Opus 4.1 in August 2025 and later Opus 4.x models; Anthropic recommends migrating to the current Claude Opus tier.\u003C/p>\u003C/details>\u003C/section>"],"uses":{"params":["slug"]}}]}
